[[3118,1181,"The pupils at Karanbir's school had a patchy understanding of his allergies, what they were and the consequences of exposure to allergens","patchy understanding of allergies",""],[3119,1181,"Karanbir's school care plan and medical box were not checked or audited to ensure, for example, that if his care plan stipulated two EpiPens® (adrenaline auto-injectors), the box contained two EpiPens","incomplete medical box contents",""],[3120,1181,"Karanbir's EpiPen was out of date","out of date medication",""],[3121,1181,"Allergy action plans are not standardised across hospitals and schools, so messages are not as clearly delivered as they could be","non-standardised allergy action plans",""],[3122,1181,"The allergy action plan drafted by Karanbir's doctors at Ealing Hospital did not find its way to his school","failure to deliver allergy action plan",""]]